fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth264parser.html#GstH264SPSExtMVC","fragment":"\n\tGstH264SPSExtMVC\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H264SPSExtMVC\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H264SPSExtMVC\n\nMembers\nRepresents the parsed seq_parameter_set_mvc_extension().\nplus 1 specifies the maximum number of coded\nviews in the coded video sequence\narray of GstH264SPSExtMVCView\nplus 1 specifies the number of\nlevel values signalled for the coded video sequence.\narray of GstH264SPSExtMVCLevelValue\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.6\n\t\t\nRepresents the parsed seq_parameter_set_mvc_extension().\nplus 1 specifies the maximum number of coded\nviews in the coded video sequence\narray of GstCodecParsers.H264SPSExtMVCView\nplus 1 specifies the number of\nlevel values signalled for the coded video sequence.\narray of GstCodecParsers.H264SPSExtMVCLevelValue\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.6\n\t\t\nRepresents the parsed seq_parameter_set_mvc_extension().\nplus 1 specifies the maximum number of coded\nviews in the coded video sequence\narray of GstCodecParsers.H264SPSExtMVCView\nplus 1 specifies the number of\nlevel values signalled for the coded video sequence.\narray of GstCodecParsers.H264SPSExtMVCLevelValue\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.6\n\t\t\n"});